From 88b2c2c1ae8ab32f4512079da80bf0895bbc53ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jcs130 <lzl1992@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 11:46:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: pace Minecraft decisions by meaningful changes instead
 of packet ticks

Nearby entity motion and sampled-block churn reset idle backoff in real captures. Keep fresh observations while deduplicating passive callbacks, share running-task updates, and retain skill readiness, rescue and conversation cues. Verified with 83 plugin tests and a 300-second replay of 150 captured snapshots.
